B.c3E=new A.fD("10-Minute Paced Breath Practice for Hot Flush Relief","Sunflower Yoga","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ju_nX7d8iJY","11 min")
B.bM1=new A.hb("hotflush","Hot flush breathing","Slow, deep belly breaths, about six a minute, when a flush starts.",B.bod,B.O4,"Riding out a hot flush, and feeling calmer through the day","Studies of paced breathing for hot flushes have had mixed results. Many women find it helps them feel calmer and more in control, and it's safe to try. If hot flushes are affecting your life, talk to your doctor about other options.",5,"breath-wave","Breathing",B.c3E)
B.aWt=s(["Sit comfortably and let your shoulders drop.","Breathe in gently through your nose for a count of 4.","Hold your breath for 4.","Breathe out slowly through your mouth for 4.","Hold, empty, for 4.","Repeat for 3 to 5 minutes. If 4 feels long, use 3."],t.s)
