B.c3q=new A.fD("Reduce anxiety and stress with the physiological sigh","Andrew Huberman (Huberman Lab)","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rBdhqBGqiMc",null)
B.bMa=new A.hb("sigh","Physiological sigh","Two breaths in, one long breath out. The quickest way to settle.",B.bn9,B.b_X,"A fast reset in the moment",null,3,null,"Breathing",B.c3q)
B.baI=s(["Sit or lie comfortably with a hand on your belly.","Breathe in through your nose for 5, feeling your belly rise.","Breathe out gently for 5.","Keep it smooth and unforced for 5 to 10 minutes.","Some women find slow breathing like this helps them ride out a hot flush; it's worth a try when one begins."],t.s)
